    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a blood clot?? i didn't know a red line meant a blood clot. and the chills being from adrenaline... that's a bit weird, i feel really weak and shaky, not just energized. i'll try the epsom salt soak, but the red line is definitely still moving. it's actually reached my elbow now and the skin feels really hot to the touch. i'm also starting to feel a bit dizzy and nauseous. do you think i should take some extra strength ibuprofen or maybe some leftover antibiotics i have in my cabinet to help with the heat and the infection? i'm really trying to avoid the ER if i can just handle this with some pills and the soak.",
